      blurb: "The Book of Koli is a 2020 post apocalyptic novel by British writer M. R. Carey. It is the first book in the Rampart Trilogy, preceding The Trials of Koli (2020) and The Fall of Koli (2021). Reviews of the book upon its release were mostly positive. The Book of Koli was nominated for a 2021 Philip K. Dick Award.",
